s the Hardware Clock via any known method.=0A[root@lbwjxqm1 ~]# ls -l /dev/=
rtc=0Acrw------- 1 root root 10, 135 Aug 27 11:44 /dev/rtc=0A=0A It is well=
 possible, that the problem is in the userspace, but how to find out?=0A=0A=
